window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Eggplant Canyon... Where 3 is never a crowd!</p> <p>All 6 stories from the Eggplant Canyon series are available in this bundle.</p> <p>Claimed by my Ex's Dad &amp; His Friend</p> <p>I thought I wanted the boy next door until I figured out his dad is one of the real men I crave.</p> <p>Claimed by my Stepbrothers</p> <p>Accidentally hooking up with my new stepbrothers leads to a weekend challenge I can't refuse.</p> <p>Heat Stroked</p> <p>A little sexy banter with my best friend's dad and another doctor ends up being anything but innocent. </p> <p>Claimed by my Boss &amp; His Twin</p> <p>My boss plays into the fantasy I've kept secret, only it's not him... it's his twin!</p> <p>Claimed by my Best Friend's Brothers</p> <p>A sexy predicament with my best friend's brothers could end our friendship.</p> <p>Claimed by my Lawyers</p> <p>My lawyers want a lot more than to win my case. Will it result in me being locked up and pregnant?</p>"; 
